/* 設定 — 說明文字 */
"A menu-bar app normally has no Dock icon. These make it findable there — permanently, or only just after it opens." = "選單列應用程式通常沒有程式塢圖示。這些選項讓它能在那裡被找到——永久顯示，或僅在啟動後短暫顯示。";
"Allows applying modes outside the safe-mode flag set — experimental." = "允許套用安全模式旗標集之外的模式——實驗性。";
"Allows turning a display fully black." = "允許將顯示器完全調暗至全黑。";
"Apple Silicon; experimental — screen goes dark while the external is connected." = "Apple 晶片；實驗性——外接顯示器連接期間螢幕會變黑。";
"Below this point on the combined scale, extra software dimming is applied." = "在組合刻度的此點以下，會額外套用軟體調暗。";
"Brief Dock icon at launch" = "啟動時短暫顯示程式塢圖示";
"Brightness the display is reduced to while locked." = "鎖定時顯示器降低到的亮度。";
"Compresses the usable software range so 0% is not absolute black." = "壓縮可用的軟體範圍，使 0% 不是絕對黑色。";
"Disconnecting a display turns it off until it is re-enabled. The built-in display is never disconnected on Macs where it may not come back without a reboot." = "中斷連接顯示器會將其關閉，直到重新啟用。在不重新啟動就可能無法回復的 Mac 上，內建顯示器永遠不會被中斷連接。";
"Display groups let one operation affect several displays: brightness synchronisation, UI scale matching and layout management." = "顯示器群組可讓一次操作影響多台顯示器：亮度同步、介面縮放相符與佈局管理。";
"Entitlement-gated on macOS 26+; has no effect there." = "在 macOS 26 及以上版本受權限限制；在那裡沒有作用。";
"Experimental direct color-table method" = "實驗性的直接色表方法";
"Hiding takes effect only while Show FBD in the Dock is on (see the OSD section): a menu-bar app with no icon and no Dock icon would have nothing left to click, so the preference is ignored until then." = "僅在開啟「在程式塢中顯示 FBD」時隱藏才會生效（見 OSD 區段）：既無選單列圖示又無程式塢圖示的選單列應用程式將沒有任何可點選之處，因此在此之前該偏好會被忽略。";
"Hold ⇧ Shift while launching, or set FBD_SAFE_MODE=1, to skip applying stored configuration for one session — the escape hatch after a bad EDID override." = "啟動時按住 ⇧ Shift，或設定 FBD_SAFE_MODE=1，可在本次執行中跳過套用已儲存的設定——EDID 覆寫出錯後的應急出口。";
"Holds a power assertion while FBD runs, so the display stays on through a long transfer, render or presentation. It ends when FBD quits — the assertion belongs to this process, which is why there is no command-line switch for it." = "FBD 執行期間保持電源斷言，使顯示器在長時間的傳輸、算圖或簡報過程中保持開啟。結束 FBD 時即結束——該斷言屬於此行程，因此沒有對應的命令列開關。";
"Keys adjust every connected display that has brightness or volume control." = "按鍵調整所有支援亮度或音量控制的已連接顯示器。";
"Keys adjust the display showing the focused window." = "按鍵調整顯示聚焦視窗的顯示器。";
"Keys adjust the display under the pointer." = "按鍵調整指標所在的顯示器。";
"Keys adjust the display whose name matches the current audio device, falling back to the display under the pointer." = "按鍵調整名稱與目前音訊裝置相符的顯示器，若無則使用指標所在的顯示器。";
"Minimum delay between consecutive DDC/CI writes per display." = "每台顯示器連續 DDC/CI 寫入之間的最短延遲。";
"Off by default: FBD only takes the F1/F2 and F10–F12 keys when you opt in. Requires Accessibility permission, and only affects keys while FBD is running." = "預設關閉：只有在您選擇啟用後，FBD 才會接管 F1/F2 與 F10–F12 鍵。需要輔助使用權限，且僅在 FBD 執行時影響這些按鍵。";
"Peak HDR brightness." = "HDR 峰值亮度。";
"Peak SDR brightness in HDR mode." = "HDR 模式下的 SDR 峰值亮度。";
"Peak brightness in nits when the hardware control is at its maximum." = "硬體控制處於最大值時的峰值亮度（尼特）。";
"Peak brightness in nits when the hardware control is at its minimum." = "硬體控制處於最小值時的峰值亮度（尼特）。";
"Propagate the first connected member's current brightness to the rest of the group." = "將首個已連接成員目前的亮度傳播到群組內其餘顯示器。";
"Re-applies a saved custom EDID whenever the display connects." = "每當顯示器連接時重新套用已儲存的自訂 EDID。";
"Re-applies the saved arrangement when the display layout changes." = "顯示器佈局變更時重新套用已儲存的排列。";
"Re-applies the selected properties when this display reconnects. Properties this display cannot report are unavailable." = "此顯示器重新連接時重新套用所選的屬性。此顯示器無法回報的屬性無法使用。";
