"The lowest hardware brightness value before software dimming takes over." = "軟體調暗接管前的最低硬體亮度值。";
"The panel shows one row per display, with brightness, filters, resolutions and XDR/HDR controls, and a footer for Virtual Screens, Groups, PiP, updates and quit." = "面板為每台顯示器顯示一列，包含亮度、濾鏡、解析度與 XDR/HDR 控制，底部還有虛擬螢幕、顯示器群組、子母畫面、更新與結束的入口。";
"The system appearance — the switch Control Center flips, so another app can change it too." = "系統外觀——與控制中心所切換的是同一個開關，因此其他應用程式也能更改它。";
"The top of the XDR/HDR upscaling range on the combined scale." = "組合刻度上 XDR/HDR 升頻範圍的上限。";
"This Mac (base M3) may not reconnect its built-in display without a reboot." = "此 Mac（基礎款 M3）可能無法在不重新啟動的情況下重新連接其內建顯示器。";
"Used when native XDR upscaling is unavailable. Requires Screen Recording permission." = "在原生 XDR 升頻無法使用時使用。需要螢幕錄製權限。";
"When off, brightness is reached through software dimming rather than the display's own backlight." = "關閉時，亮度透過軟體調暗而非顯示器本身的背光來達成。";
